---
import Layout from '../../layouts/RealestateLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Cory Wong | Real Estate Agent | Trustwell Realty Inc., Brokerage"
  description="Cory Wong is a Real Estate Agent with Trustwell Realty Inc., Brokerage, serving Toronto, Markham, and Richmond Hill. Learn about his approach to client service."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <!-- About Hero -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-hero__inner">
        <img
          src="/headshot.jpg"
          alt="Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent"
          class="about-hero__photo"
          width="280"
          height="280"
        />
        <div class="about-hero__intro">
          <h1 class="about-hero__name">About Cory Wong</h1>
          <p class="about-hero__subtitle">Real Estate Agent</p>
          <p class="about-hero__brokerage">Trustwell Realty Inc., Brokerage</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bio Content -->
  <section class="bio">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <p class="bio__text">
        I work in real estate because it suits how I think and what I'm good at. Buying or
        selling a home is one of the biggest financial decisions most people make. It deserves
        clear thinking, honest communication, and someone who takes the details seriously.
      </p>
      <p class="bio__text">
        I'm licensed with Trustwell Realty Inc., Brokerage, and I focus on Toronto, Markham,
        and Richmond Hill. I also serve clients across York Region, Peel Region, and Durham
        Region.
      </p>
      <p class="bio__text">
        Before real estate, I worked as a professional writer and spent years as a
        Toastmaster. That background shapes how I communicate with clients &mdash; clearly,
        concisely, and without jargon. Whether it's a market update, a pricing
        recommendation, or an offer negotiation, I make sure you understand what's happening
        and why.
      </p>
      <p class="bio__text">
        I'd rather show than tell. That means regular updates instead of silence, honest
        assessments instead of inflated promises, data-driven pricing instead of guesswork,
        and prepared negotiation instead of winging it. You'll always know where you stand.
      </p>
      <p class="bio__text">
        The GTA market is not simple right now. Rates, inventory, and buyer sentiment shift
        from month to month. My job is to cut through the noise, give you the information
        that actually matters for your situation, and help you make confident decisions.
      </p>
      <p class="bio__text">
        If you're thinking about buying or selling, I'd be happy to have a conversation.
        No pressure, no pitch &mdash; just an honest look at your options.
      </p>

      <!-- Service Areas -->
      <div class="service-areas">
        <h2 class="section-heading">Service Areas</h2>
        <div class="service-areas__content">
          <div class="service-area">
            <h3 class="service-area__label">Primary</h3>
            <p class="service-area__text">Toronto, Markham, Richmond Hill</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service-area">
            <h3 class="service-area__label">Additional</h3>
            <p class="service-area__text">York Region, Peel Region, Durham Region</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="about-cta">
        <a href="/contact" class="cta cta--primary">Book a Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Content width */
  .content-narrow {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Section Heading */
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  /* About Hero */
  .about-hero {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  .about-hero__inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-hero__photo {
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    object-fit: cover;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .about-hero__intro {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .about-hero__name {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .about-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .about-hero__brokerage {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  /* Bio */
  .bio {
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .bio__text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  /* Service Areas */
  .service-areas {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .service-areas__content {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .service-area__label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .service-area__text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .about-cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cta--primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cta--primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-hero__inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .about-hero__photo {
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
    }

    .service-areas__content {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .about-cta {
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
